{"accent":"#cdea44","bgFrom":"#0f2027","bgTo":"#2c5364","captions":[{"end":4,"start":0,"text":"Capek ngedit video manual?"},{"end":8,"start":4,"text":"Ada cara bikin video otomatis, gratis."},{"end":13,"start":8,"text":"Tulis naskah, klik render, jadi MP4."},{"end":18,"start":13,"text":"Caption, animasi, watermark — otomatis semua."},{"end":24,"start":18,"text":"Nggak perlu laptop. Dari HP bisa."},{"end":30,"start":24,"text":"Rahasianya: Remotion + GitHub Actions."},{"end":36,"start":30,"text":"Remotion itu library React buat bikin video."},{"end":42,"start":36,"text":"GitHub Actions yang renderin — gratis."},{"end":48,"start":42,"text":"Lu cuma edit teks dari HP, sisanya otomatis."},{"end":54,"start":48,"text":"Template-nya open source, tinggal pakai."},{"end":60,"start":54,"text":"Link di bio. Follow buat part 2!"}],"durationSec":60,"handle":"@adiprmx","title":"Bikin video TikTok otomatis? Gratis."}